<!--
Questo è il tuo primo post di prova: riscrivilo come vuoi, oppure cancellalo
quando pubblichi il primo post vero. Ogni post è una cartella dentro posts/
con un file index.qmd: copia questa cartella, cambia nome e data, e scrivi.
-->
<p>This is the first post on this blog. The idea is simple: take one question at a time, look at the data, and try to reason about it like an economist, carefully, with the mechanism spelled out and the obvious objections answered. It is a gym for training my thinking, and writing is the best method.</p>
<p>To check that everything works, here is a chart made in R directly inside the post. It uses the <code>economics</code> dataset that comes with ggplot2 (US monthly data from FRED).</p>
